{{!
  @template mod_moodleoverflow/mail/layout_html

  The frame of every HTML mail: one column with the heading, the content and a muted footer below it. The mails
  extend it and fill its blocks. Mail clients ignore stylesheets, so all styles are inline and the layout uses tables;
  core wraps the result in core/email_html, so this is a body fragment without <html> and <head>.

  Context variables required for this template:
  * heading - What the mail is about, e.g. "New post in the course Programming 101"
  * subheading - Optional second line below the heading, e.g. "Forum: Lecture Q&A"
  * footerlinks - Links below the content (e.g. to unsubscribe), each with url and label

  Blocks:
  * preheader - The text mail clients show next to the subject in the inbox
  * content - The mail itself, below the heading

  The footer links work like table cells without media queries (many mail clients ignore them): each link is at
  least 196px wide (with its gap) and never wraps, so three fit in a row of the 600px column, and on a phone every
  link gets its own line. font-size:0 on the row removes the gaps between the inline blocks.

  Example context (json):
  {
    "heading": "New post in the course Programming 101",
    "subheading": "Forum: Lecture Q&A",
    "footerlinks": [
      {"url": "https://example.com/mod/moodleoverflow/discussion.php?d=2&unsubscribe=1",
       "label": "Unsubscribe from this discussion"},
      {"url": "https://example.com/user/forum.php", "label": "Forum preferences"}
    ]
  }
}}
<div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;">{{$preheader}}{{/preheader}}</div>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="background-color:#ffffff;">
<tr><td align="center" style="padding:24px 12px;">
    <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"
           style="max-width:600px;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;">
    <tr><td style="font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#1d2125;">
        <h1 style="margin:0;font-size:20px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:600;color:#1d2125;">{{heading}}</h1>
        {{#subheading}}
        <div style="margin-top:4px;font-size:15px;color:#6a737b;">{{subheading}}</div>
        {{/subheading}}
        <div style="margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e9ecef;"></div>
        {{$content}}{{/content}}
    </td></tr>
    {{#footerlinks.0}}
    <tr><td style="padding-top:32px;font-size:0;line-height:0;">
        <div style="margin-bottom:12px;border-top:1px solid #e9ecef;"></div>
        {{#footerlinks}}
        <div style="display:inline-block;min-width:180px;padding:4px 16px 4px 0;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;
                    font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;">
            <a href="{{url}}" style="color:#6a737b;">{{label}}</a>
        </div>
        {{/footerlinks}}
    </td></tr>
    {{/footerlinks.0}}
    </table>
</td></tr>
</table>
